OL,3,GNEWSAStourbridge fires that razed 19
OL,4,Ahomes accidental
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo fires that destroyed 19 homes in
OL,7,FStourbridge were started accidentally
OL,8,Fin fields where farming machinery was
OL,9,Fin use, according to West Midlands Fire
OL,10,FService.
OL,12,FInvestigators established agricultural
OL,13,Fequipment was being used in the
OL,14,Fvicinity of fields immediately before
OL,15,Fthe fires were first reported. The
OL,16,Fservice would not confirm the type of
OL,17,Fmachinery.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
