OL,3,GNEWSAStourbridge fires that razed 19
OL,4,Ahomes accidental
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first fire started in a field near
OL,7,FRacecourse Lane at about 13:27 BST on
OL,8,F13 August, while a second began shortly
OL,9,Fafterwards in a field near Quarry Park
OL,10,FRoad.
OL,12,FThe day after the fires the government
OL,13,Fsent out an emergency alert to millions
OL,14,Fof people across England and Wales,
OL,15,Fwarning them against "any activity that
OL,16,Fcould start a fire".
